cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the software and the article below."
title: "Ward-relevant IMU transition recognition — analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and reproduction notebook for a public-data feasibility
  benchmark of gyroscope-dependent recognition of bed-exit-relevant postural
  transitions from a waist-worn six-axis inertial measurement unit, including
  the sensor ablations, the foundation-model comparison, the label-efficiency
  analysis, and the alarm-threshold, event-level, and boundary-window scoring.
